Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 07:28:19 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Audio: SPU2 AutoDMA, completion scheduling and a
 drift-absorbing PCM queue

Former patches of the series, merged:
- 0049: SPU2: AutoDMA input, volume registers at 0x760, AVOL/BVOL roles
- 0057: IOP: deliver SPU2 AutoDMA completions at their sample
- 0058: Audio: absorb clock drift without dropping PCM blocks
